-- Icy Shatter's SP coefficient (docs/single-rank-spell-system.md: spell_bonus_data is the
-- authoritative coefficient mechanism in this codebase, not a Spell.dbc field). Mirrors Glacial
-- Spike's own 200002 entry exactly.
