-- ---------------------------------------------------------------
-- Frost Mage rework: Glacial Spike (200002) redesigned as a 3-stage "ramp-up" missile chain,
-- to fake mid-flight acceleration for its projectile (docs/frost-mage-handoff.md's art-pass
-- discussion) - Spell.dbc only exposes one constant Speed per spell and the engine has no
-- acceleration field at all, and the native SPELL_EFFECT_TRIGGER_MISSILE_SPELL DBC chain can't
-- give a short controlled hop distance while keeping a real enemy unit as the target (see
-- spell_mage_glacial_spike's class comment in spell_mage.cpp for the full mechanical reasoning).
--
-- 200002 (the button/cast-bar spell) no longer deals damage or travels itself - effect1 is now a
-- no-op DUMMY, Speed removed. On hit (instant), it hand-drives three stages via
-- spell_mage_glacial_spike::BeginRamp:
--   - 200025 "Glacial Spike (Windup 1)" - cosmetic dest-targeted hop, Speed 1.0, ~0.5yd (~0.5s)
--   - 200026 "Glacial Spike (Windup 2)" - cosmetic dest-targeted hop, Speed 5.0, ~1.5yd (~0.3s)
--   - 200027 "Glacial Spike (Impact)" - the real hit, Speed 30.0, same 1500 base Frost damage +
--     1.2 SP coefficient 200002 itself used to carry. Icicle/Fingers-of-Frost consumption and the
--     Arctic Winds shatter-cleave both moved here too (spell_mage_glacial_spike_impact), since
--     this is the stage that now represents the spell actually landing.
--
-- All three new rows are internal plumbing, never cast by a player directly - see each row's own
-- notes in apps/dbc-tools/source/spells/mage.csv for the full per-field reasoning.
--
-- Hand-extracted from generate.py's full output per this repo's standing practice (every run also
-- reproduces a large pre-existing unrelated diff - 613 spells/16 talents this time - that must not
-- be folded into an unrelated migration). The reserved block (200000-209999) is re-emitted in
-- full (27 rows now, +3), not just the changed/new ones, because DELETE ... WHERE ID BETWEEN is
-- range-based - see apps/dbc-tools/README.md's "New content" emission rule.
--
-- Source of truth: apps/dbc-tools/source/spells/mage.csv. Regenerate with:
-- python3 apps/dbc-tools/generate.py
DELETE FROM `spell_dbc` WHERE `ID` BETWEEN 200000 AND 209999;
